  "query_preview": "..\n(Tuesday through Sunday)\nIssued at 1221 AM CDT Mon Jun 15 2026\n\nThe first significant heat event is likely Wednesday and Thursday\nacross much of the area with highs of 100 to 105. The hottest day\nwill be Thursday with a medium to high chance of heat index \nvalues reaching 105 to 110 across much of the area. Also, an upper\nlevel ridge and low level thermal ridge will be over the area, \nenhancing the heat even more. Heat Advisories and Excessive Heat \nWarnings may be needed mid to late this week. An unsettled weather\npattern and slightly cooler temperatures return late this week \nand weekend with scattered mainly afternoon and evening \nthunderstorms. Please keep up with the latest weather information \nmainly for possible heat headlines.",
